a(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; ProjectSelector</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-gm4wd2z9\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SMW7QDjF\">查询adv下的项目数据，用于拉取和进一步检索明细数据</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-J0eSJ4nn\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3Sryp2SW\">初始化 ProjectSelector，并初始化了 advertiser_id</p></blockquote></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2yPIWiw0\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-QL8hAqxP\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-M3zAGZIR\">promotionSelector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-uADhZlIJ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qHg12lyp\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; PromotionSelector</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-9E4LJLof\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-477kpKdr\">查询adv下的广告数据，用于拉取和进一步检索明细数据</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-kYa3Q3Ua\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Fyu0AYyC\">初始化 PromotionSelector，并初始化了 advertiser_id</p></blockquote></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-A8VvX4vs\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-2NJK3KKd\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vDU3BNcS\">reportSelector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-lRdRfKSe\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fxYdue32\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; ReportSelector</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-bi22gOEd\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FcqvG6ta\">查询adv下的报表数据，用于拉取和进一步检索明细数据</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-AfBa7SrH\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jjI4fa3L\">初始化 ReportSelector，并初始化了 advertiser_id</p></blockquote></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-99TpE5el\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-99TpE5el\">代码示例</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cn